# Halalit hand-vetted list agent

**When** the owner is in **hand-vetted list** mode (they type titles to log, not yes/no/idk plot-vet batches):

## Mode

- **Input-driven:** owner supplies title(s). Do **not** offer ~30-book plot-vet batches unless they ask.
- **Freeform OK:** `Title — Author — clean, Older kids` or a short list; parse and confirm only if verdict or age band is unclear.
- **Not My TBR:** staging read-later → `halalit/.cursor/private/HALALIT-MY-TBR-LIST.md` (see `halalit-my-tbr-list-private.mdc`).

## After each message

1. **Pen names** — follow `halalit-vet-pen-names.mdc` when an author is named.
2. **Roster** — update `halalit/HALALIT-HAND-VETTED-CLEAN-LIST.md` (correct section: Kids / Older kids / Teens/Adults / Parked / Removed).
3. **Live Bookcheck** — update `halalit/www/halalit-curated-shelf-warnings.js`:
   - clean → `VERIFIED_CLEAN`
   - flagged / no Book Quest → `FLAG_REVIEW` or remove from `VERIFIED_CLEAN`
   - heavy fanservice → `NO_RECOMMEND_KNOWN_FANSERVICE`
   - lighter comic caution → `FANSERVICE_CAUTION_GRAPHIC`
   - deity/mythology on hand-vetted clean → `VERIFIED_CLEAN` + `requiresDeityMythologyOptIn` (Book Quest when reader hasn’t excluded deity/mythology)
   - deity/mythology catalog-only / not verified → `DEITY_COMFORT`
   - parked → off `VERIFIED_CLEAN`; note in roster Parked section
4. **Age bands** — when verified clean with a band, sync `halalit/www/halalit-bookquest-age-ratings.js` (see file header; match existing `titleRe` / `authorRe` patterns).
5. **Deploy** — follow `warn-before-live-user-impact`: if `halalit/www/` changed, use a **Live impact** block (vet/shelf rules) and wait for owner OK before `deploy-kids-sites.sh`.
6. **Reply** — short summary per title: what tier, age band, and files touched.

## Do not

- Re-run plot-vet batch flows (`halalit-plot-vet-no-repeat.mdc`) unless the owner switches to that mode.
- Put My TBR or staging-only rows on the live site without an explicit ask.

**Full workflow:** project skill `halalit-hand-vetted-list` (`.cursor/skills/halalit-hand-vetted-list/SKILL.md`).
